request access to a dataset, approve or reject an access request, share a listing with a project, who has access to this table, revoke access, bulk revoke, is the access actually gone, subscription grant status. Not for: IAM roles, policies or STS (use aws-iam), S3 bucket policies (use securing-s3-buckets), Clean Rooms permissions (use aws-cleanrooms), or writing catalog metadata, glossaries and forms, publishing listings, or retiring or deleting an asset that other teams are subscribed to and the order of operations that needs (use managing-data-catalog)\n\n\nServices: datazone\nTasks: deploy, audit\nPersona: data-engineer, developer, architect\nWorkload: data-analytics\n*","skill_name":"managing-data-asset-access"},{"rank_order":5,"title":"redshift-guide","skill_description":"Amazon Redshift is NOT PostgreSQL; corrects LLM mistakes; covers SQL, metadata, connectivity/auth, storage, query performance, and operations. Applies ONLY to Redshift (provisioned or Serverless). Pushes back on: CREATE INDEX, string_agg, pg_catalog, text type, SERIAL, stl_query. Triggers on: Redshift SQL, Redshift CREATE TABLE, Redshift COPY/UNLOAD, slow or suddenly slow Redshift query, EXPLAIN plan, queue wait, stale statistics/ANALYZE, result cache, Redshift permission denied, Redshift disk full, storage growth, snapshot/backup cost, ghost rows/bloat, VACUUM, spill to disk, distribution skew, Redshift system views, QUALIFY, PIVOT, MERGE, materialized views, Redshift Data API (Python/boto3), Redshift workload management (WLM), concurrency scaling, Redshift resize, Spectrum, awsdatacatalog, connection failures (SSL/TLS, ODBC/JDBC, connection limit), IAM/SAML federation, IAM Identity Center, datashares. Does NOT apply to: S3 policies, Athena, Glue/Iceberg outside Redshift, Aurora, RDS, DynamoDB.\n\nServices: redshift, redshift-serverless, redshift-data-api\nTasks: query, debug, optimize\nPersona: developer, data-engineer, database-administrator, data-analyst\nWorkload: data-warehouse, analytics, etl\n*","skill_name":"redshift-guide"}]}}"}]}], "label": "Check Sonnet 5 quota burndown details"}

